# QA bug report

Write one issue per report. Be factual. Do not assign blame.

## Template

```markdown
# Bug: [what fails] when [condition]

## Description
Impact in one or two sentences.

## Environment
- Browser / project: Chromium | Firefox | WebKit
- OS:
- App URL / build:
- Test (if any): `tests/...spec.ts`

## Severity
Critical | High | Medium | Low | Trivial — plus a one-line why.

## Steps to reproduce
1.
2.
3.

## Expected
What the user should see.

## Actual
What happened instead.

## Evidence
Trace, screenshot, video, or console error. Quote the error; do not dump secrets.
```

## Rules

- Numbered steps that a stranger can follow.
- Include exact locator text, URL, and error message when known.
- If a Playwright test already fails, cite the spec name and the assertion.
- Suggest a possible cause only when you have evidence from a trace or log.
